+/**
+	* Rate limit a PKO port to a max packets/sec. This function is only
+	* supported on CN57XX, CN56XX, CN55XX, and CN54XX.
+	*
+	* @port:      Port to rate limit
+	* @packets_s: Maximum packet/sec
