+	* A few defines are used to control the operation of this driver:
+	*  USE_ASYNC_IOBDMA
+	*      Use asynchronous IO access to hardware. This uses Octeon's asynchronous
+	*      IOBDMAs to issue IO accesses without stalling. Set this to zero
